{
  "title": "EOL Risk Overview",
  "description": "Software end-of-life risk for your environment, powered by endoflife.ai (0-100 EOL Risk Scores, vendor-verified dates). Catalog-wide risk plus stack-scan metrics scoped to your detected hosts. Learn more: https://endoflife.ai",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "About endoflife.ai",
        "type": "group",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "note",
              "content": "## endoflife.ai \u2014 EOL Risk Overview\n\n**Risk Score (0\u2013100)**: EOL recency + attack surface + CISA KEV exposure + extended-support availability. Higher = more dangerous to keep running. Grades: A (low) to F (critical).\n\n**Two lenses:** catalog metrics (`endoflife.risk_score`, `endoflife.days_until_eol`) cover the full tracked catalog; **stack-scan metrics** (`endoflife.stack_risk_score`) are scoped to hosts detected in *your* Datadog account, tagged by `host_name`. `eol_phase` splits products **approaching** EOL (plan the upgrade) from **past** EOL (remediate \u2014 no patches are coming).\n\nDates verified against vendor documentation \u2014 methodology: https://endoflife.ai/accuracy",
              "background_color": "yellow",
              "font_size": "14",
              "text_align": "left",
              "vertical_align": "center",
              "show_tick": false,
              "tick_pos": "50%",
              "tick_edge": "left",
              "has_padding": true
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 2
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Overview",
        "type": "group",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Past EOL + actively exploited (CISA KEV)",
              "type": "query_value",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query1",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "min:endoflife.days_until_eol{kev_active:true,$product,$eol_phase,$grade} by {product}",
                      "aggregator": "last"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "count_nonzero(clamp_max(query1, -1))"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 0,
              "custom_links": [],
              "timeseries_background": {
                "type": "area"
              }
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 2,
              "width": 3,
              "height": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Average EOL Risk Score",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "description": "Current average across the full catalog of 500+ monitored products.",
              "type": "query_value",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "query1"
                    }
                  ],
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query1",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "avg:endoflife.risk_score{*}",
                      "aggregator": "avg"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar"
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": false,
              "precision": 2,
              "custom_unit": "",
              "conditional_formats": [
                {
                  "comparator": "<",
                  "value": 40,
                  "palette": "white_on_green"
                },
                {
                  "comparator": "<",
                  "value": 60,
                  "palette": "white_on_yellow"
                },
                {
                  "comparator": ">=",
                  "value": 60,
                  "palette": "white_on_red"
                }
              ],
              "timeseries_background": {
                "type": "area"
              }
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 3,
              "y": 2,
              "width": 3,
              "height": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Nearest upcoming EOL deadline (days)",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "query_value",
              "precision": 0,
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query1",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "min:endoflife.days_until_eol{eol_phase:approaching,$product,$grade}",
                      "aggregator": "last"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "query1"
                    }
                  ],
                  "conditional_formats": [
                    {
                      "comparator": "<=",
                      "value": 30,
                      "palette": "white_on_red"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": "<=",
                      "value": 90,
                      "palette": "white_on_yellow"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": ">",
                      "value": 90,
                      "palette": "white_on_green"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "timeseries_background": {
                "type": "area"
              }
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 6,
              "y": 2,
              "width": 3,
              "height": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Hosts running at-risk software (stack scan)",
              "type": "query_value",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query1",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "max:endoflife.stack_risk_score{*} by {host_name}",
                      "aggregator": "last"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "count_nonzero(query1)"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 0,
              "timeseries_background": {
                "type": "area"
              }
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 9,
              "y": 2,
              "width": 3,
              "height": 2
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Stack Scan \u2014 Your Hosts",
        "type": "group",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Your riskiest hosts (stack scan)",
              "type": "toplist",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query1",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "max:endoflife.stack_risk_score{*} by {host_name,product}",
                      "aggregator": "last"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "query1",
                      "limit": {
                        "count": 15,
                        "order": "desc"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "sort": {
                    "count": 25,
                    "order_by": [
                      {
                        "type": "formula",
                        "index": 0,
                        "order": "desc"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "custom_links": [
                {
                  "label": "View {{product.value}} on endoflife.ai",
                  "link": "https://endoflife.ai/{{product.value}}"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Full risk-score methodology",
                  "link": "https://endoflife.ai/risk-score"
                }
              ]
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 4,
              "width": 6,
              "height": 3
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Lifecycle Deadlines \u2014 Approaching vs Past",
        "type": "group",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Approaching EOL \u2014 days remaining",
              "type": "toplist",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query1",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "min:endoflife.days_until_eol{eol_phase:approaching,$product,$grade} by {product}",
                      "aggregator": "last"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "query1",
                      "limit": {
                        "count": 15,
                        "order": "asc"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "sort": {
                    "count": 25,
                    "order_by": [
                      {
                        "type": "formula",
                        "index": 0,
                        "order": "asc"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "custom_links": [
                {
                  "label": "View {{product.value}} on endoflife.ai",
                  "link": "https://endoflife.ai/{{product.value}}"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Full risk-score methodology",
                  "link": "https://endoflife.ai/risk-score"
                }
              ]
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 6,
              "y": 4,
              "width": 3,
              "height": 3
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Past EOL \u2014 days overdue",
              "type": "toplist",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query1",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "min:endoflife.days_until_eol{eol_phase:past,$product,$grade} by {product}",
                      "aggregator": "last"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "abs(query1)",
                      "limit": {
                        "count": 15,
                        "order": "desc"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "sort": {
                    "count": 25,
                    "order_by": [
                      {
                        "type": "formula",
                        "index": 0,
                        "order": "desc"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "custom_links": [
                {
                  "label": "View {{product.value}} on endoflife.ai",
                  "link": "https://endoflife.ai/{{product.value}}"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Full risk-score methodology",
                  "link": "https://endoflife.ai/risk-score"
                }
              ]
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 9,
              "y": 4,
              "width": 3,
              "height": 3
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Catalog Risk Breakdown",
        "type": "group",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Products by Risk Grade",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "description": "Share of monitored products by risk band \u2014 the widest wedges are where remediation effort concentrates.",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "query": "count:endoflife.risk_score{*} by {grade}",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "query1",
                      "aggregator": "max"
                    }
                  ],
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "datadog16"
                  },
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "query1"
                    }
                  ],
                  "sort": {
                    "count": 500,
                    "order_by": [
                      {
                        "type": "formula",
                        "index": 0,
                        "order": "desc"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "type": "sunburst",
              "legend": {
                "type": "automatic"
              }
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 7,
              "width": 4,
              "height": 4
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Critical Risk Products (Grade F)",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "description": "Products with critical EOL risk requiring immediate action!",
              "type": "toplist",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "query1",
                      "query": "max:endoflife.risk_score{grade:f} by {product}",
                      "aggregator": "avg"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "query1"
                    }
                  ],
                  "sort": {
                    "count": 10,
                    "order_by": [
                      {
                        "type": "formula",
                        "index": 0,
                        "order": "desc"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "style": {
                "display": {
                  "type": "stacked",
                  "legend": "automatic"
                }
              }
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 4,
              "y": 7,
              "width": 4,
              "height": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Products by lifecycle phase",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "description": "How many tracked products are approaching EOL vs already past it.",
              "type": "bar_chart",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "query1",
                      "query": "count:endoflife.risk_score{*} by {eol_phase}",
                      "aggregator": "max"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "query1"
                    }
                  ],
                  "sort": {
                    "count": 10,
                    "order_by": [
                      {
                        "type": "formula",
                        "index": 0,
                        "order": "desc"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "response_format": "scalar"
                }
              ],
              "style": {
                "display": {
                  "type": "stacked",
                  "legend": "automatic"
                }
              }
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 8,
              "y": 7,
              "width": 4,
              "height": 2
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "CISA KEV Exposure",
        "type": "group",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Active CISA KEV + Critical Products",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "toplist",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "query1",
                      "query": "avg:endoflife.risk_score{kev_active:true} by {product}",
                      "aggregator": "avg"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "query1"
                    }
                  ],
                  "sort": {
                    "count": 25,
                    "order_by": [
                      {
                        "type": "formula",
                        "index": 0,
                        "order": "desc"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "style": {
                "display": {
                  "type": "stacked",
                  "legend": "automatic"
                }
              }
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 4,
              "y": 9,
              "width": 4,
              "height": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Critical/KEV Risk Score Trend (30d)",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "show_legend": true,
              "legend_layout": "auto",
              "legend_columns": [
                "avg",
                "min",
                "max",
                "value"
              ],
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "timeseries",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query1",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "avg:endoflife.risk_score{kev_active:true} by {product}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "top(query1, 8, 'mean', 'desc')"
                    }
                  ],
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "order_by": "values",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "display_type": "line"
                }
              ]
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 8,
              "y": 9,
              "width": 4,
              "height": 2
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Product Detail & Trends",
        "type": "group",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "EOL Risk by product \u2014 score, grade, KEV, phase",
              "type": "query_table",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "score",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "max:endoflife.risk_score{$product,$eol_phase,$grade} by {product,eol_date,grade,kev_active,eol_phase}",
                      "aggregator": "max"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "score",
                      "conditional_formats": [
                        {
                          "comparator": ">=",
                          "value": 80,
                          "palette": "white_on_red"
                        },
                        {
                          "comparator": ">=",
                          "value": 60,
                          "palette": "white_on_yellow"
                        },
                        {
                          "comparator": "<",
                          "value": 60,
                          "palette": "white_on_green"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  "sort": {
                    "count": 100,
                    "order_by": [
                      {
                        "type": "formula",
                        "index": 0,
                        "order": "desc"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "custom_links": [
                {
                  "label": "View {{product.value}} on endoflife.ai",
                  "link": "https://endoflife.ai/{{product.value}}"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Full risk-score methodology",
                  "link": "https://endoflife.ai/risk-score"
                }
              ]
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 11,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 4
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Risk posture trend (30d) \u2014 average score and past-EOL count",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "show_legend": true,
              "legend_layout": "horizontal",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "alias": "Average EOL Risk Score",
                      "formula": "query1"
                    }
                  ],
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query1",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "avg:endoflife.risk_score{$product,$eol_phase,$grade}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "timeseries",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "orange",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "display_type": "line"
                },
                {
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "alias": "Products past EOL",
                      "formula": "count_nonzero(query2)"
                    }
                  ],
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query2",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "avg:endoflife.risk_score{eol_phase:past,$product,$grade} by {product}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "timeseries",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "warm",
                    "line_type": "dashed",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "on_right_yaxis": true
                }
              ],
              "time": {
                "live_span": "30d"
              }
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 15,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 3
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "product",
      "prefix": "product",
      "available_values": [],
      "default": "*"
    },
    {
      "name": "eol_phase",
      "prefix": "eol_phase",
      "available_values": [],
      "default": "*"
    },
    {
      "name": "grade",
      "prefix": "grade",
      "available_values": [],
      "default": "*"
    }
  ],
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "notify_list": [],
  "pause_auto_refresh": false,
  "reflow_type": "fixed"
}
